                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is not what the store page says it is. It is not a long journey. The achievement is not unlockable.\n\n+ Great music\n+ Great variance in environments\n* Succession of different environments\n* No interactivity, only walking\n- Numerous graphical glitches (there are intended glitches later on, but that's not what I'm referring to)\n- Pretty bad controls (walking up long stairs stops at some steps because the step is too high, so you have to jump - no visual indication of this, so looks like a trivial bug)\n- Playthrough in 10-15 mins.\n- Varying framerate even on powerful system\n- Not unlockable achievement\n- Misleading store description\n- Wrong advertised hardware requirements (7.3 GB install, not 50 MB)",
